/>

<div class="city-content">

<div class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">
LONDON • UNITED KINGDOM
</div>

<h3>
Global.
Timeless.
Personal.
</h3>

<p>

Private touring,
executive transportation
and curated London experiences
designed around your priorities.

</p>

</div>

</article>


<article class="city-card">

<img
  src="/images/travaza/paris.png"
  alt="Paris"
/>

<div class="city-content">

<div class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">
PARIS • FRANCE
</div>

<h3>
Culture,
elevated.
</h3>

<p>

Private touring,
culinary experiences,
executive transportation
and bespoke Paris itineraries.

</p>

</div>

</article>

</section>


<!-- TORONTO -->

<section class="toronto">

<div class="container toronto-grid">

<div class="toronto-mark">
Toronto
</div>

<div>

<div class="eyebrow">
TORONTO • CANADA
</div>

<h2 class="section-title">
Our city.
Your Toronto.
</h2>

<p class="destination-copy-large">

Executive transportation,
private city experiences,
professional sports,
corporate programs,
concerts,
airport movements
and custom itineraries throughout Toronto and Southern Ontario.

</p>

<div class="micro-grid">

<div class="micro-item">
Executive Transportation
</div>

<div class="micro-item">
Private Experiences
</div>

<div class="micro-item">
Professional Sports
</div>

<div class="micro-item">
Corporate Programs
</div>

<div class="micro-item">
Airport Transfers
</div>

<div class="micro-item">
Large Group Movements
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<!-- NIAGARA -->

<section class="niagara">

<div class="container">

<div class="niagara-heading">

<div class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">
NIAGARA FALLS • CANADA + USA
</div>

<h2 class="section-title">
Two countries.
One extraordinary destination.
</h2>

<p class="section-copy">

Private experiences,
iconic attractions,
wine country,
cross-border touring
and local expertise on both sides of Niagara Falls.

</p>

</div>


<div class="niagara-grid">


<article class="niagara-card">

<img
  src="/images/travaza/journey-behind-the-falls-couple.png"
  alt="Niagara Falls Canada"
/>

<div class="niagara-content">

<div class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">
NIAGARA FALLS CANADA
</div>

<h3>
Experience the Falls,
privately.
</h3>

<p>

Journey Behind the Falls,
Niagara City Cruises,
wine country,
private touring
and curated Canadian-side experiences.

</p>

</div>

</article>


<article class="niagara-card">

<img
  src="/images/travaza/cave-winds.png"
  alt="Niagara Falls USA"
/>

<div class="niagara-content">

<div class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">
NIAGARA FALLS USA
</div>

<h3>
Closer than
you imagined.
</h3>

<p>

Niagara Falls State Park,
Maid of the Mist,
Cave of the Winds,
private guides
and custom American-side experiences.

</p>

</div>

</article>


</div>

</div>

</section>


<!-- GUYANA -->

<section class="guyana">

<img
  class="guyana-bg"
  src="/images/travaza/kaieteur-falls.png"
  alt="Kaieteur Falls Guyana"
/>

<div class="container guyana-content">

<div class="year">
TRAVAZA DESTINATION OF THE YEAR • 2026
</div>

<div
  class="eyebrow eyebrow-light"
  style="margin-top:25px;"
>
GUYANA
</div>

<h2>
Go before
everyone else does.
</h2>

<p class="guyana-lead">

Guyana is entering an extraordinary new chapter.

With one of the world's fastest-growing economies,
extraordinary landscapes
and a rich multicultural identity,
it is becoming one of South America's
most compelling emerging destinations.

</p>

<div class="guyana-services">

{
  guyanaServices.map(
    service => (

<span class="guyana-service">
{service}
</span>

    )
  )
}

</div>

<div style="margin-top:32px;">

<a
  href="#consultation"
  class="button button-gold"
>
Discover Guyana
</a>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<!-- SECOND NEW YORK EDITORIAL -->

<section class="editorial-image">

<img
  src="/images/travaza/New-york.png"
  alt="New York private travel"
/>

<div class="container editorial-content">

<div class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">
TRAVEL BUILT AROUND YOU
</div>

<h2>
Your itinerary
shouldn't look
like everyone else's.
</h2>

<p>

Travaza brings transportation,
destination expertise,
hospitality
and private experiences together
to create journeys designed around the people taking them.

</p>

</div>

</section>


<!-- GLOBAL MOVEMENT -->

<section
  id="global-movement"
  class="global-movement"
>

<div class="container">


<div class="global-movement-header">

<div>

<div class="eyebrow">
GLOBAL MOVEMENT
</div>

<h2 class="section-title">
Every movement,
considered.
</h2>

</div>


<div class="global-movement-lead">

The best transportation is almost invisible.

It arrives where it should,
when it should,
with the right vehicle,
the right information
and the right people behind it.

Travaza coordinates the journey between the moments that matter.

</div>

</div>


<div class="global-movement-grid">

{
  globalMovement.map(
    item => (

<article class="movement-row">

<div class="movement-number">
{item.number}
</div>

<h3>
{item.title}
</h3>

<p>
{item.text}
</p>

</article>

    )
  )
}

</div>


<div class="movement-closing">

<h3>

One traveller or one thousand.
One city or several countries.

</h3>

<a
  href="#consultation"
  class="button button-gold"
>
Plan Your Movement
</a>

</div>


</div>

</section>


<!-- LUXURY STATEMENT -->

<section class="luxury-statement">

<div class="container">

<div class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">
THE TRAVAZA STANDARD
</div>

<blockquote>

Luxury isn't simply
where you stay.

<br />

<span>

It's knowing everything
has already been handled.

</span>

</blockquote>

</div>

</section>


<!-- CONSULTATION -->

<section
  id="consultation"
  class="consultation"
>

<div class="container consultation-grid">


<div>

<div class="eyebrow">
PRIVATE CONSULTATION
</div>

<h2 class="section-title">
Where would you
like to go next?
</h2>

<p class="consultation-copy">

Every journey begins with a conversation.

Tell us who is travelling,
where you want to go,
what matters most
and what you would like us to handle.

We'll help structure the rest.

</p>

<div class="direct">

Travel Planning & Reservations

<br />

<a href="mailto:reservations@travaza.com">
reservations@travaza.com
</a>

</div>

</div>


<form
  class="form"
  name="travaza-charter-request"
  method="POST"
  data-netlify="true"
  netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
  action="/thank-you"
>

<input
  type="hidden"
  name="form-name"
  value="travaza-charter-request"
/>

<p style="display:none;">

<label>
Do not fill:
<input name="bot-field" />
</label>

</p>


<h3>
Begin Planning
</h3>


<div class="form-grid">


<div class="field">

<label for="name">
Name *
</label>

<input
  id="name"
  name="name"
  type="text"
  required
/>

</div>


<div class="field">

<label for="company">
Company / Organization
</label>

<input
  id="company"
  name="company"
  type="text"
/>

</div>


<div class="field">

<label for="email">
Email *
</label>

<input
  id="email"
  name="email"
  type="email"
  required
/>

</div>


<div class="field">

<label for="phone">
Phone
</label>

<input
  id="phone"
  name="phone"
  type="tel"
/>

</div>


<div class="field full">

<label for="service">
How can we assist?
</label>

<select
  id="service"
  name="service"
>

<option>
Private Travel
</option>

<option>
Custom Travel Experience
</option>

<option>
Private Chauffeur
</option>

<option>
Executive Transportation
</option>

<option>
Corporate Program
</option>

<option>
Professional Sports Team
</option>

<option>
Musician / Touring Production
</option>

<option>
Private Jet Charter
</option>

<option>
Private Yacht
</option>

<option>
Global Movement
</option>

<option>
Coach Charter
</option>

<option>
Large Group Transportation
</option>

<option>
Guyana Travel
</option>

<option>
Niagara Falls
</option>

<option>
Private Tour
</option>

<option>
Other
</option>

</select>

</div>


<div class="field">

<label for="date">
Starting Date
</label>

<input
  id="date"
  name="date"
  type="date"
/>

</div>


<div class="field">

<label for="passengers">
Number of Guests
</label>

<input
  id="passengers"
  name="passengers"
  type="number"
  min="1"
/>

</div>


<div class="field">

<label for="origin">
Starting Location
</label>

<input
  id="origin"
  name="starting_location"
  type="text"
/>

</div>


<div class="field">

<label for="destination">
Destination
</label>

<input
  id="destination"
  name="destination"
  type="text"
/>

</div>


<div class="field full">

<label for="details">
Tell Us About Your Journey
</label>

<textarea
  id="details"
  name="details"
  placeholder="Destinations, hotels, flights, private aviation, yachts, transportation, experiences, events, guides, special access, group logistics or anything else you would like Travaza to handle."
></textarea>

</div>


</div>


<button
  type="submit"
  class="submit"
>
Request a Private Consultation
</button>


</form>


</div>

</section>


</main>


